  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "One task's current state"
 },
 "description": "One task on the signed-in person's move: what it is, when it is due, what state it is in, any draft already prepared, and which fields it is waiting on them to answer. Read-only \u2014 opening a task leaves no trace. It does not tell you whether the task is in flight: that needs evidence lookups this cheap read skips on purpose. move_tasks is the only place \"in progress\" appears.",
